{
  "title": "圆台内接正方形与线面角",
  "problem_html": "<p>圆台的下底面圆 O 的半径为 <span class='t' data-el='circle_bottom'>$\\sqrt{2}$</span>，ABCD 为圆 O 的内接正方形，E、M 为上底面圆 O1 上两点，F 为 BC 的中点，且 <span class='t' data-el='pl_ABE'>$平面\\ ABE\\perp$</span> <span class='t' data-el='pl_ABCD'>$平面\\ ABCD$</span>，<span class='t' data-el='ln_AF'>$AF\\perp DE$</span>。<br/>(1) 求证：<span class='t' data-el='eq_EAEB'>$EA=EB$</span>；<br/>(2) 若 <span class='t' data-el='ln_OO1'>$OO_1=2$</span>，直线 <span class='t' data-el='ln_FM'>$FM$</span> 与平面 <span class='t' data-el='pl_ADE'>$ADE$</span> 所成角正弦值为 <span class='t' data-el='sin_val'>$\\dfrac{3\\sqrt{10}}{10}$</span>，求线段 <span class='t' data-el='ln_ME'>$ME$</span> 长度。</p>",
  "questions": [
    {
      "label": "(1)",
      "html": "求证：<span class='t' data-el='eq_EAEB'>$EA=EB$</span>"
    },
    {
      "label": "(2)",
      "html": "若 <span class='t' data-el='ln_OO1'>$OO_1=2$</span>，<span class='t' data-el='ln_FM'>$FM$</span> 与 <span class='t' data-el='pl_ADE'>$ADE$</span> 所成角正弦值为 <span class='t' data-el='sin_val'>$\\dfrac{3\\sqrt{10}}{10}$</span>，求 <span class='t' data-el='ln_ME'>$ME$</span> 的长度。"
    }
  ],
