  "solution_script": [
    {
      "phase": "审题",
      "speech": "同学们好，我们来看这道圆台中的立体几何题。题目给出圆台下底半径为根号2，内接正方形ABCD，点E和M在上底圆上，F是BC的中点，并且平面ABE垂直于底面ABCD，还给了AF垂直于DE的条件。",
      "els": [
        "circle_bottom",
        "pl_ABCD",
        "pl_ABE",
        "ln_AF"
      ],
      "cam": [
        5,
        4,
        5,
        0
      ],
      "math": [
        {
          "type": "tex",
          "v": "OA=OB=OC=OD=\\sqrt{2}"
        },
        {
          "type": "desc",
          "v": "正方形ABCD内接于底圆"
        }
      ],
      "clear": false
    },
    {
      "phase": "审题",
      "speech": "我们先来建系。以圆心O为原点，x轴沿OA方向，z轴沿OD方向，y轴竖直向上经过O1点。这样四个顶点坐标可以立即写出来。",
      "els": [
        "coord_axes",
        "O",
        "A",
        "D"
      ],
      "cam": [
        5,
        4,
        5,
        0
      ],
      "math": [
        {
          "type": "desc",
          "v": "坐标系建立："
        },
        {
          "type": "tex",
          "v": "O(0,0,0),\\ A(1,0,0),\\ B(1,0,2),\\ C(-1,0,2),\\ D(-1,0,0),\\ O_1(0,2,0)"
        }
      ],
      "clear": false
    },
    {
      "phase": "审题",
      "speech": "注意正方形的对角线AC和BD都在xoz平面上，它们交于原点O。而F是BC的中点，所以F的坐标是(1, 0, 1)。",
      "els": [
        "F",
        "ln_AF",
        "ln_FM"
      ],
      "cam": [
        4,
        3,
        5,
        0
      ],
      "math": [
        {
          "type": "tex",
          "v": "F\\left(1,0,1\\right)\\quad(\\text{BC的中点})"
        }
      ],
      "clear": false
    },
    {
      "phase": "审题",
      "speech": "接下来我们来处理两个关键条件。先设E点在顶圆的坐标为(√2cosα, 2, √2sinα)，再利用AF⊥DE这个垂直条件来确定E的位置。",
      "els": [
        "ln_OE",
        "ln_OO1"
      ],
      "cam": [
        3,
        2.5,
        5,
        0
      ],
      "math": [
        {
          "type": "tex",
          "v": "E(\\sqrt{2}\\cos\\alpha,\\ 2,\\ \\sqrt{2}\\sin\\alpha)\\quad(\\text{在圆}O_1上)"
        }
      ],
      "clear": false
    },
    {
      "phase": "第(1)题",
      "speech": "好，我们先证明第一问EA=EB。计算向量AF和DE的坐标：AF等于F减A，DE等于E减D。",
      "els": [
        "vec_AF",
        "vec_DE",
        "ln_AF",
        "ln_DE"
      ],
      "cam": [
        3,
        2,
        4,
        0
      ],
      "math": [
        {
          "type": "tex",
          "v": "\\overrightarrow{AF}=\\overrightarrow{OF}-\\overrightarrow{OA}=\\left(1-\\sqrt{2}\\cos\\alpha,\\ 2,\\ 1-\\sqrt{2}\\sin\\alpha\\right)"
        },
        {
          "type": "tex",
          "v": "\\overrightarrow{DE}=\\overrightarrow{OE}-\\overrightarrow{OD}=\\left(\\sqrt{2}\\cos\\alpha+1,\\ 2,\\ \\sqrt{2}\\sin\\alpha\\right)"
        }
      ],
      "clear": false
    },
    {
      "phase": "第(1)题",
      "speech": "AF⊥DE意味着它们的点积为零。把两个向量代入点积公式展开。",
      "els": [
        "ln_AF",
        "ln_DE"
      ],
      "cam": [
        3,
        2,
        4,
        0
      ],
      "math": [
        {
          "type": "tex",
          "v": "\\overrightarrow{AF}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{DE}=\\left(\\sqrt{2}\\cos\\alpha+1\\right)\\left(1-\\sqrt{2}\\cos\\alpha\\right)+2\\cdot2+\\left(\\sqrt{2}\\sin\\alpha-1\\right)\\left(\\sqrt{2}\\sin\\alpha+1\\right)=0"
        }
      ],
      "clear": false
    },
    {
      "phase": "第(1)题",
      "speech": "展开后，第一项和第三项分别是1减2cos²α和2sin²α减1，相加等于cos²α。加上常数4减1，总和为零化简得cosα等于0。",
      "els": [
        "ln_OE"
      ],
      "cam": [
        3,
        2,
        4,
        0
      ],
      "math": [
        {
          "type": "tex",
          "v": "2-2\\cos^2\\alpha+3+2\\sin^2\\alpha-1=0\\Rightarrow\\cos\\alpha=0"
        },
        {
          "type": "tex",
          "v": "\\Rightarrow E(0,2,\\pm\\sqrt{2})"
        }
      ],
      "clear": false
    },
    {
      "phase": "第(1)题",
      "speech": "取E等于(0, 2, 负根号2)，现在验证EA和EB的模长，它们都等于2，所以EA确实等于EB。",
      "els": [
        "vec_EA",
        "vec_EB",
        "ln_EA",
        "ln_EB",
        "eq_EAEB"
      ],
      "cam": [
        3,
        2,
        4,
        0
      ],
      "math": [
        {
          "type": "tex",
          "v": "EA=|\\overrightarrow{OA}-\\overrightarrow{OE}|=|(1,0,\\sqrt{2})|=2"
        },
        {
          "type": "tex",
          "v": "EB=|\\overrightarrow{OB}-\\overrightarrow{OE}|=|(1,0,2+\\sqrt{2})|=2"
        }
      ],
      "clear": false
    },
    {
      "phase": "第(1)题",
      "speech": "我们也可以从几何角度验证：计算AB向量和AE向量的叉积，得到平面的法向量是(0, -2√2, 0)，这是一个纯水平的向量。",
      "els": [
        "vec_AB",
        "vec_AE",
        "nrm_ABE",
        "pl_ABE"
      ],
      "cam": [
        4,
        2.5,
        4,
        0
      ],
      "math": [
        {
          "type": "tex",
          "v": "\\vec{n}_{ABE}=\\overrightarrow{AB}\\times\\overrightarrow{AE}=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec{i}&\\vec{j}&\\vec{k}\\\\2&0&2\\\\-1&2&-\\sqrt{2}\\end{vmatrix}=\\left(0,-2\\sqrt{2},0\\right)"
        }
      ],
      "clear": false
    },
    {
      "phase": "第(1)题",
      "speech": "因为平面ABCD的水平法向量是(0, 1, 0)，它与平面ABE的法向量点积为零，所以两个平面确实垂直。这与E的坐标满足AF·DE=0是一致的。",
      "els": [
        "nrm_ABCD",
        "pl_ABCD",
